{
"file": 1114,
"paths": [
"d009/d027/f041"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "c18b52b9",
"en_raw": "Seems you're doing well"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ab801e8f",
"en_raw": "Naoki is too good a kid"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "3f3352bc",
"en_raw": "it seems"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "12b3210d",
"en_raw": "If there's something to say"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "adcc7686",
"en_raw": "better let it out"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "c5798ad6",
"en_raw": "And now is when your body grows"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "612c8c28",
"en_raw": "so exercise too"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "0ed76e3b",
"en_raw": "It'll be fine"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "ba75f757",
"en_raw": "I see"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2d4392c6",
"en_raw": "Then I'll stop"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "90d6a1ac",
"en_raw": "worrying so much"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "9bbf23ea",
"en_raw": "...Oops, time to leave"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "85a8d905",
"en_raw": "I'll call again"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "312a5501",
"en_raw": "Take care!"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "d01815a2",
"en_raw": "Now, now"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "14833f8c",
"en_raw": "...How about you, Dad?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a1c24f95",
"en_raw": "Busy lately"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4e25e9dd",
"en_raw": "I want Japanese food"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "5cf97520",
"en_raw": "but I can't come home for a while"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "c6bd9e7c",
"en_raw": "...Sorry"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "c1f8bf1f",
"en_raw": "careful"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "386ef2d2",
"en_raw": "I heard from Mom"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "4f280416",
"en_raw": "...Nao, it's your dad"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "95bc9f69",
"en_raw": "Anything to say?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "2a1c7387",
"en_raw": "Nope"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "52b70d79",
"en_raw": "Nao is a good boy"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "efe27536",
"en_raw": "Since you went abroad"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "6a6406a1",
"en_raw": "he's become quieter than before"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "b47ae00b",
"en_raw": "That's a good thing, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "00922b59",
"en_raw": "I wonder"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f308272f",
"en_raw": "To me he looks somehow"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "ab562b4b",
"en_raw": "unbalanced"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "e2e71c3b",
"en_raw": "...Where did he leave"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "7c609d81",
"en_raw": "his rebellious phase"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "51db0f36",
"en_raw": "Aren't you a little"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "bc3795fe",
"en_raw": "too close to him?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "e0fa111e",
"en_raw": "If you spoil a boy too much"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a3172966",
"en_raw": "he won't grow strong"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "e4d19c7a",
"en_raw": "...You only say irresponsible things"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "36e6f0f5",
"en_raw": "Do you seriously"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "93352f79",
"en_raw": "think about the family?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "57cc11db",
"en_raw": "Well, getting nervous"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "cd9b9fdb",
"en_raw": "isn't good for either of us"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "86871634",
"en_raw": "We'll make time to talk about this..."
}
]
}